  "title": "Qayerda? Joy ifodalari",
  "title_de": "Wo ist das?",
  "goal": "Dars oxirida \"Wo ist ...?\" savoliga javob berasiz: narsa qayerda turgani, yotgani yoki osilib turganini \"auf/unter/neben/hinter/an/in + dem/der\" bilan aytasiz.",
  "skill_focus": [
    "grammar",
    "listening",
    "speaking"
  ],
  "explanation": [
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Joyni aytish uchun predlog va artikl kerak. \"Wo?\" (qayerda?) savoliga javobda artikl o'zgaradi — bu Dativ (A2 da batafsil o'rganamiz). Hozir uni tayyor shakl sifatida yodlang:"
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "headers": [
        "Jins",
        "Asl shakl",
        "Wo? (qayerda?)"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "der",
          "der Tisch",
          "auf dem Tisch"
        ],
        [
          "das",
          "das Bett",
          "unter dem Bett"
        ],
        [
          "die",
          "die Tür",
          "neben der Tür"
        ],
        [
          "in + das/der",
          "das Zimmer",
          "im Zimmer (in + dem)"
        ],
        [
          "in + die",
          "die Küche",
          "in der Küche"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "headers": [
        "Predlog",
        "Ma'nosi",
        "Misol"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "auf",
          "ustida",
          "auf dem Tisch — stol ustida"
        ],
        [
          "unter",
          "ostida",
          "unter dem Bett — karavot ostida"
        ],
        [
          "neben",
          "yonida",
          "neben dem Sofa — divan yonida"
        ],
        [
          "hinter",
          "orqasida",
          "hinter dem Haus — uy orqasida"
        ],
        [
          "an",
          "(devorda, deraza oldida)",
          "an der Wand — devorda"
        ],
        [
          "in",
          "ichida",
          "im Schrank — shkafda"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Uchta fe'lga e'tibor bering: liegen — yotmoq (kitob, telefon, gilam), stehen — turmoq (stul, shkaf, shisha), hängen — osilib turmoq (rasm, lampa, kurtka)."
    },
    {
      "type": "tip",
      "text": "O'zbek tilida joy qo'shimchasi so'z oxirida keladi (stol ustida), nemis tilida esa predlog so'z oldida: auf dem Tisch. Yana: links — chapda, rechts — o'ngda."
    }
  ],
